        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-11-21T16:21:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm convinced! 2a! Rabit is correct as to my reasoning, but I have no problem with the \"reveal and compare to nothing so discard\" ruling. Strong work, everyone!</p><p>And thanks for keeping it civil and friendly! You are the best forum community ever. We will certainly win in the upcoming forum wars.</p>",
