        "cooked": "<p>![](upload://fySPYAyUqExEaFrjtsIiAE6aRPv.gif)</p><p>I... I got something rules-related correct?!</p><p>![](upload://6A5wpzZptIyX2sOudzzo7YLBFSS.gif)</p><p>wow</p><p>![](upload://jmG3LQlF5SuLT7HrfVzYrp9QfUn.gif)</p><p>Excuse me for a moment. I'm going to go write this down for future reference...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>![](upload://lNCUQFYSA7ZMqVCMtPuFwzz40RT.gif)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks for the response, Christopher!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And now that the training phase for the upcoming forum wars is done, we can get started on the instigation phase... ![](upload://aGE2c3IS9RoPq4cpkzxSdmkaIPg.gif)</p>",
